		notes: `FNB Jersey City, with our partner organization NJ Sisterhood, shares healthy vegetarian food, clothes, and hygiene products with anyone who is in need at the Journal Square plaza every Sunday at noon (excluding the last Sunday of the month). Most of the people we share with are homeless, or in very serious need. We have a very friendly community based on solidarity and sharing. Our network of volunteers also advocates for homeless rights, welcoming refugees and the Muslim community to the JC area, local sustainability efforts, $15/hr minimum wage, and other social justice initiatives. Meet at the 9/11 Memorial Fountain, which is directly across the street from the Loew's Landmark Theater.`
